Audio blocks carry `src` and `caption` in the header. The body is whatever you
want to say about the sound.

`preload="none"` is not optional — nothing downloads until someone presses
play. One track left preloading on a page is heavier than every word on this
site put together.

Transclude this into a collection with `![[field-recording]]` and the player
comes with it.
